  "description": "ShadowDusk ShaderToy front-end: a pure-managed, zero-native converter that translates a ShaderToy / plain-GLSL fragment shader into a self-contained HLSL .fx source (ShaderToyConverter.Convert). The .fx then compiles to MonoGame/KNI (OpenGL/DirectX) and FNA via ShadowDusk.Compiler or the ShadowDuskCLI tool. Standalone and optional, not part of the faithful mgfxc-replacement pipeline.",
